    "note": "Reviewed fresh PyPI/npm candidates for all direct build, runtime, optional/development and Node dependencies, including versions outside declared upper bounds. Compared with the committed 0.39.12 audit, hatchling advanced from 1.32.3 to 1.32.4 and markdownlint-cli2 from 0.23.2 to 0.23.3; all other direct candidate versions are unchanged and their identical-version upstream reviews carry forward. Reviewed https://hatch.pypa.io/dev/history/hatchling/ (1.32.4 restores BuildHookInterface plugin compatibility and fixes CalVer whitespace) and the upstream markdownlint-cli2 0.23.3 package CHANGELOG (dependency updates). Installed both latest candidates; Core wheel build with hatchling 1.32.4 succeeded, strict typing/lint verification is separate, npm reports no vulnerabilities, and uv pip check passed for 36 packages. All direct latest candidates satisfy bounds and support Python 3.14. Version 0.40.0 changes unpublished sealed-observation reuse and adds bounded reobservation hints; schema epoch 3/version 7 is unchanged. Runtime tests, manual live-MariaDB/deep experiments and exact-tree release validation are separate evidence, not implied by this dependency audit.",
